OL,3,GNEWSAMan hit with 'death tax' after
OL,4,Ainheriting mother's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved man says he has been hit
OL,7,Fwith a "death tax" after inheriting his
OL,8,Fmother's home.
OL,10,FPhil Bond, 68, lost his mother, Eunice,
OL,11,F91, in May and inherited her house in
OL,12,FCardiff, alongside his brother.
OL,14,FSoon after her death, they received a
OL,15,Fcouncil tax bill that included a charge
OL,16,Ffor "premium furnished and no-one
OL,17,Fresident", doubling the annual amount
OL,18,Fowed to more than #4,000.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
