OL,3,GNEWSAMan hit with 'death tax' after
OL,4,Ainheriting mother's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Wales, local authorities can charge
OL,7,Fa council tax premium of up to 300% on
OL,8,Ffurnished second homes, which his
OL,9,Fmother's property had been reassigned
OL,10,Fas.
